docs {
  # List Usulan Pengabdian
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/usulan-pengabdian`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token  
  **Roles:** admin, dosen, mahasiswa
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Query Parameters)
  
  ```typescript
  interface ListPengabdianQuery {
    page?: number;           // Default: 1
    limit?: number;          // Default: 10
    status?: string;         // Filter status
    tahun_akademik?: string; // Filter tahun
  }
  ```
  
  | Param | Type | Required | Default |
  |-------|------|----------|---------|
  | page | number | ❌ | 1 |
  | limit | number | ❌ | 10 |
  | status | string | ❌ | - |
  | tahun_akademik | string | ❌ | - |
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil daftar usulan pengabdian",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "judul": "Program Pelatihan Kewirausahaan Digital",
        "abstrak": "Pelatihan untuk...",
        "status": "Draft",
        "tipe_usulan": "pengabdian",
        "peran": "Ketua",
        "createdAt": "2025-01-08T10:00:00.000Z",
        "ketua": {
          "id": "uuid",
          "name": "Dr. Ahmad Fauzi"
        },
        "tahunAkademik": {
          "id": "uuid",
          "tahun": "2024/2025"
        }
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 10,
      "total": 15,
      "totalPages": 2
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
}
